    chapter("cheats", "Cheats and downloaded databases", "Find a game, enable codes and update without a new APK",
        topic("Open the cheat manager", "Use Sidebar → Cheats, directly below Controls, to open the cheat manager, or open Cheats from a running game's menu or its assigned shortcut. The duplicate Cheats tab is not shown in main Settings. Game-specific settings retain their Cheats page. This changes where the manager is opened, not your downloaded databases or saved codes."),
