        topic("Paste, import and reload", "Use Paste for a supported PS1 code, or Import for a compatible cheat file. Give custom codes meaningful names, check the target game and reload when needed. GameShark/Action Replay-style names do not imply every code encoding is supported; unsupported entries cannot safely be applied. PS2 PNACH files are not PS1 cheat files."),
