    chapter("companion", "Dual-screen CTR companion", "Race HUD and what is game-specific",
        topic("Enable the CTR companion", "Use the CTR companion controls for a supported Crash Team Racing game/device setup. The companion is game-specific, not a generic two-screen mode for all PS1 games. Its available setting governs whether the race HUD is moved away from gameplay. Confirm the game/region is supported before expecting live race data."),
        topic("Race HUD and non-race screens", "During a supported race the companion displays the map, item box, timer/laps/Wumpa information and eight racer positions/portraits while keeping gameplay on the other screen. Boot/menu companion screens are not a guarantee of a live map in every adventure area. Disable the companion to return to ordinary single-screen presentation if the game state is unsupported."),
